# Mistlock Causeway (CIPlay mistlock_causeway): The Lullaby Frequency's sixth island, quest "Walk Where She Sings". The
# lagoon at -1.5 m between z -26 and 26; the causeway's decks 0.8 m over the water (2.3 m over the lagoon floor) on x 0,
# forking on x -6 / 6 at z -16.5..-10.5 (safe: left) and 4.5..10.5 (safe: right); the start at 0 -30 (teleport target
# 0 -32), the midpoint 0 -3, the gatehouse's door at 0 30, the lever at 2.8 28.6 (hidden; its handle-less post there).
# DEEP 10-25: Lamplighter's Tor at 50 10 (foot zone hillfoot at 27.45 5.49), the toll house at -80 10 (-14 m), the
# pilgrims' cave zone at -40 57.
island Mistlock Causeway
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Walk Where She Sings
wait 3
walk 0 -40 to 0 -31 h=0.9
zone causeway_start
expect step 1
read Pilgrim's rule
expect step 2
zone wrong_turn
expect message back at the start
walk 0 -30 to 0 -25
walk 0 -25 to 0 -19.5 to -6 -19.5 to -6 -7.5 to 0 -7.5 to 0 -3 h=0.8
zone midpoint
expect step 3
walk 0 -3 to 0 1.5 to 6 1.5 to 6 13.5 to 0 13.5 to 0 23.5 h=0.8
walk 0 23.5 to 0 28
zone gatehouse
expect step 4
expect hidden lever
use leverpost
expect message no handle
zone hillfoot
expect step 5
zone hilltop
expect step 6
read Lamplighter Edwin Sallow's log
expect step 7
open Lamplighter's chest
expect story leverhandle 1
expect step 8
zone tollhouse
expect step 9
air tollair
read Toll keeper Marta Lund's note
expect step 10
zone pilgrimcave
read Pilgrim Josef Brandt's note
open Pilgrims' box
expect step 10
walk 0 24 to 0 28 h=0.9
use leverpost
expect shown lever
expect hidden leverpost
expect step 11
use lever
expect message Twenty seconds
expect step 12
use lever
expect message still open
walk 0 28.5 to 0 31 to 0 32.5 h=0.9
open Pilgrim's satchel
expect item Spear_Scrap 1
expect done
